      "death_date": "",
      "cemetery_location": "",
      "full_text": "He is survived by two sisters, Marion Hughes and Edna M. Loatman, both of Fairfield \n  Township; and several nieces, nephews, cousins and friends. He was predeceased \n  by five brothers, Edward and Joseph Reed and John, Frank and Ted Coker; and \n  a sister, Lethia Carter.",
